      "y": 496,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "PROBLEM:\n- Both routes resolve branch HEAD to SHA independently\n- 4-5 GitHub API calls per quality fetch\n- action=latest cache only 5 min (branch can change)\n- No SHA reuse between tree and quality fetches"
