      "type": "text",
      "x": 227,
      "y": 1197,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "BENEFITS:\n- Only 1 SHA resolution (in tree fetch)\n- 2-3 GitHub API calls total (was 4-5)\n- action=commit cache 10 min (immutable per SHA)\n- Cache hit rate higher due to SHA-based keys"
    }
